      "Section": "Skills",
      "Anchor": "skills",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Skills API provides standardized skills data across the LinkedIn platform.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Skills",
      "Anchor": "skills",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Skills represent professional competencies on LinkedIn member profiles and job postings (e.g., \u0022Project Management\u0022, \u0022Python\u0022, \u0022Financial Analysis\u0022).",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Skills",
      "Anchor": "skills",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Skills",
      "Anchor": "skills",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "This API may also be referred to as \u0022Competency\u0022 or \u0022Expertise\u0022 in other contexts.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Skills",
      "Anchor": "skills",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Skills",
      "Anchor": "skills",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Get a skill entity by its ID.\nBatch get skills for the set of skill IDs.\nGet all skills.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "How to Retrieve Skill IDs",
      "Anchor": "how-to-retrieve-skill-ids",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How to Retrieve Skill IDs"
      ],
      "Text": "Use GET_ALL with pagination to list all skills. Skill IDs also appear in responses from other DMA APIs such as Organizational Page Edge Analytics.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
